    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Magic tinged blood flows through your eyes, causing them to glow in a haze that creates a stark light as you channel ancestral powers. Through it you can see the flow of magic, blood and vitality in a creature. For the next minute, any slashing, piercing or precision damage you deal adds 2 persistent bleed damage, and when you Seek and see a creature, you can tell if they bleed and if they are capable of any form of magic. If your Seek check beats their Deception and Stealth DC, you can tell if they belong to the undead, fey, or dragon families without requiring a Recall Knowledge check.</span></p>"
